      "basis": "The draft: \"The request error result map must not contain an entry with key {\"data\"}.\" October 2021 (§7.1.1): \"If an error was raised before execution begins, the data entry should not be present in the result.\" A request error with \"data\": null is still a request error for the vector's own check, and fails this one.",
